  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is projected from the ground with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with horizontal so that its range and maximum height are equal, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;will be equal to",
